WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/components/feedback/ErrorDisplay.tsx (+ its layout primitive _ErrorState.tsx) — the status-aware
  error banner for NON-query failures (mutation failures, imperative fetches). It MIRRORS QueryError's
  status branches but with two deliberate differences: it does NOT read isTransientWaiting (no "waiting"
  branch) and it installs NO useEffect (no auto-retry on reconnect); instead it adds a `compact` density
  prop for inline contexts. Branches:
    • !error                       → renders nothing (`return null`).
    • status === 404               → FileQuestion, "{{thing}} not found" (thing = resourceName ?? "Resource"),
                                     optional "Back to list" CTA when listHref is set → navigate(listHref).
    • status === 401 || 403        → Lock, "Sign in required", "Sign in" CTA → window.location.href='/login'.
    • status >= 500                → Server, "Server error", optional "Retry" CTA → onRetry.
    • network / offline / unknown  → WifiOff if offline else AlertCircle; isOffline = !online || status === 0;
                                     offline → role=status/polite "You're offline" + disabled "Retry when
                                     online"; else role=alert/assertive "Can't reach server" + "Retry".
  `compact` (web _ErrorState): tighter padding (p-4→p-3), gap (gap-3→gap-2), icon box (p-2→p-1.5) and icon
  size (h-4→h-3.5) for inline mutation errors.
  Data sources (hooks): useTranslation (→ P1/S10 facade), useNavigate (→ P4 nav seam), useOnlineStatus
  (→ the reactive `online` field of the P1/S8 snapshot). `error` is a prop, mapped to a Shared-free
  classification at the seam (only `isApiError(error) ? error.status : undefined` is read).

DELTA vs the QueryError sibling (P4/0133, the documented template)
  - NO `.waiting` mode; ErrorFailure carries only `status: Int?` (no transient axis — ErrorDisplay never
    imports isTransientWaiting).
  - NO reconnect auto-retry in the state holder (web ErrorDisplay has no useEffect). Verified by
    testReconnectDoesNotAutoRetry.
  - ADDS ErrorDisplayDensity { comfortable, compact } (web `compact`) threaded input → model.density →
    card + loading (container padding, row gap, icon-box padding, icon point size).
  - KEEPS: P4 leaf states (loading/empty/stale/offline), one-shot stale auto-refresh, navigator (404
    back-to-list, 401 /login), view.opened telemetry (slug "ErrorDisplay"), per-surface i18n facade.

