  useNavigate / /login   → ErrorDisplayNavigator.navigate(to:) — 404 listHref + 401 "/login".
  useOnlineStatus        → ErrorDisplayInput.online → connection axis (offline copy + freshness chip).
  view.opened (P1/S11)   → ErrorDisplayTelemetry.viewOpened(surface:"ErrorDisplay") on first appear.

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → density-aware skeleton failure tile (parent resolving the operation).
  empty    → "All clear" TSEmptyState card (web returns null; P4 leaf — never a blank box).
  failure  → the classified tile: the four web branches with per-mode copy + CTA.
  stale    → freshness chip + one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition.
  offline  → "You're offline" copy + offline freshness chip + disabled "Retry when online".

